  "title": "Salmon and Rice Bowl",
  "blurb": "A quick, nourishing bowl with flaked salmon, fluffy rice and peppery greens.",
  "steps": [
    "Rinse the rice under cold water, then cook according to packet instructions until tender and the water is absorbed.",
    "Drain the canned salmon and flake it into chunks with a fork, removing any skin or bones.",
    "Wash and roughly chop the coriander.",
    "Juice the lemon into a small bowl and whisk in the olive oil with a pinch of salt.",
    "Divide the cooked rice between four bowls and top each with flaked salmon and baby arugula.",
    "Scatter over the chopped coriander, drizzle with the lemon dressing and season with black pepper to taste."
